# One line ending everywhere, decided here rather than by whoever cloned last.
#
# The CI formatting gate runs on Linux and compares byte for byte. Without
# this, a file written on Windows arrives with CRLF, `dart format` rewrites it
# to LF, and the check fails on a change nobody made.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
